                                    <div class="card-body">
                                        <header class=community-development>
                                            <h2>
                                                <a href=/community-development/workforce-and-economic-development/skills-based-occupational-transitions-for-covid-19-displaced-workers-in-the-philadelphia-metro-area>
                                                    Skills-Based Occupational Transitions for COVID-19 Displaced Workers
                                                </a>
                                            </h2>
                                                    <div class="article-authors-date">
                                                        <p class="article-author-by">by</p>
                                                        <ul class="authors">
<li class="author"><span itemprop="author">Kyle DeMaria</span></li>                                                        </ul>
                                                        <p class="article-date">November 2020</p>
                                                    </div>
                                        </header>
                                        <p class="article-excerpt">As the country responds to dual health and economic crises, displaced workers will confront a central question: Will they be able to return to their previous jobs or will they need to transition into new lines of work?</p>
